      "explanation": "'Зацепить' means 'to catch, hook, or snag accidentally'. The prefix 'за-' adds the meaning of catching onto something. 'Пряник зацепил лапой' = Pryanik snagged (the cable) with his paw. The instrumental case 'лапой' shows the body part used. Similar verbs: задеть (to touch/bump), зацепиться (to get caught on).",
